  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Missing Data: Designing for the \"Oops\"\r\n\r\nBased on the following user complaint about the Concert App bug (Level 1), design the UI for what should appear on screen instead:\r\n\r\n> **The Ghost Map:** “The page loaded, but the seat map is blank.”\r\n\r\nUse simple boxes and labels to show your layout. Your sketch must include three elements:\r\n\r\n1. **The Message:** Explain what happened in plain English. Avoid using \"Error 404\" or \"Null\".\r\n2. **The Action:** Give the user a clear next step, e.g., a \"Retry\" button, a \"Contact Support\" link, or a \"Return to Home\" option.\r\n3. **The Tone Check:** Ensure the tone is calm and helpful. Avoid scary icons or blaming the user.",
